### Archivo de pruebas para la API de autenticación
### Puedes usar esto con la extensión REST Client de VS Code
### o copiar los comandos cURL que están comentados

### 1. Registrar un nuevo usuario
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jugador1",
  "email": "jugador1@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### cURL:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"username\":\"jugador1\",\"email\":\"jugador1@example.com\",\"password\":\"password123\"}"

###

### 2. Login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jugador1@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### cURL:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"email\":\"jugador1@example.com\",\"password\":\"password123\"}"

###

### 3. Obtener perfil (reemplaza YOUR_TOKEN con el token que obtuviste del login)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### cURL:
# curl -X GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/profile -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN"

###

### 4. Actualizar estadísticas del juego (reemplaza YOUR_TOKEN)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/auth/game-stats
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "highScore": 2000,
  "level": 5,
  "totalGamesPlayed": 10,
  "totalPlayTime": 3600
}

### cURL:
# curl -X PUT http://localhost:3001/api/auth/game-stats -H "Content-Type: application/json" -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" -d "{\"highScore\":2000,\"level\":5,\"totalGamesPlayed\":10,\"totalPlayTime\":3600}"

###

### 5. Verificar token (reemplaza YOUR_TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### cURL:
# curl -X GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/verify -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN"
